athan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_02_59","text":"In the aftermath, Behemoth's core was the only thing left, and that's what's recovering inside that egg.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_02_60","text":"Those people you fought with were chasing after me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_02_61","text":"... B-Behemoth lost to them?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_02_62","text":"Yeah. But it won't happen again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_02_63","text":"Behemoth transformed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Chap_34_07","bgArt":"eventscene_chap_34_07","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_02_64","text":"Really?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_38_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_38_02_65","text":"Yeah. It was really cool. Those morons who were following us were paralyzed with fear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinit